<title>SOUTH AFRICA: SAfrica's Molope Bakeries in talks, advises caution.</title>
<headline>SAfrica's Molope Bakeries in talks, advises caution.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-03-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Molope Bakeries Ltd advised shareholders on Friday that negotiations of a sensitive nature were underway which, if successfully concluded could have an effect on the value of the shares of the company.</p>
<p>Shareholders were advised to exercise caution in dealings.</p>
<p>The company said that shareholders would be advised of further details in due course.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482-1003</p>
</text>
